bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    mir_enum_payload_inline_none_lowered_as_nil_2026-11-10, 0, "Phase-3 stage3 build (stage2_new4.exe) rejects inline `None` in a declared `T?` enum payload slot as a NilLit: MirInstKind.Call(None, ...) at string_builder_opt.spl:197:71 (also HirTypeKind.Array/HirExprKind.IntLit sites). The HIR node at the None span reaches MIR as HirExprKind.NilLit; pure-Simple lowering and minimal stage2 builds admit the same shapes, so the defect is in the stage2-native path, root cause not yet located."

